{
  "_about": "Hand-maintained payment-calendar obligations. Each obligation declares WHEN a recurring payment is expected per hotel and which account funds it; scripts/estimate_payment_calendar.py fills in the AMOUNT from the prior-year actual in the closest week (data/vendor_histories.json) and writes rows to the avr-finance table that the Finance > Payment Calendar tab renders. Edit freely and re-run the script. 'schedule' is one of {\"monthly\":{\"day\":N}}, {\"weekly\":{\"weekday\":\"Fri\"}}, {\"dates\":[\"MM-DD\",...]}; optional \"months\":[1,4,7,10] restricts to those months; optional \"amount\":N overrides the estimate; \"source\" lists the vendor name(s) in vendor_histories.json to read amounts from (default: the obligation 'vendor'). 'dept' is used only when 'line' is not a standard USALI line.",
  "settings": {
    "forward_months": 18,
    "tolerance_days": 21
  },
